PanoptiDNS shares AllKnowingDNS's configuration file format, and its test suite
ports the acceptance vectors from AllKnowingDNS's test files in order to preserve
behavioural compatibility.

No AllKnowingDNS source code is included in, or derived into, this work. The
implementation was written from scratch in Rust against the observable behaviour
documented by those test vectors.

See docs/MIGRATION-from-AllKnowingDNS.md for the behavioural differences.
